# all-help-no-harm hook environment (dotenvx)
#
# hooks.json wraps the SessionStart, PostCompact and UserPromptSubmit hooks in
#   dotenvx run --env-file=${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.env -- node ...
# dotenvx exits with code 9 and never runs the hook when the file named by
# --env-file does not exist (the --ignore=MISSING_ENV_FILE flag does not cover
# an explicit --env-file path). This file therefore has to exist even when it
# defines nothing.
#
# Optional variables:
#   ANTHROPIC_CONTRACT_LOG_KEY  API key the hooks use to post an independent
#                               contract-affirmation audit record. When unset,
#                               the hooks skip that call silently.
#
# To set it encrypted in place:
#   dotenvx set ANTHROPIC_CONTRACT_LOG_KEY <key> -f <plugin-root>/.env
# That writes the private key to .env.keys next to this file. .env.keys must
# never be committed.
